Template: kamstrup2mqtt/device
Type: string
Default: /dev/ttyUSB0
Description: Serial device path:
 The path to the serial device connected to the Kamstrup meter.

Template: kamstrup2mqtt/baud
Type: string
Default: 2400
Description: Serial baud rate:
 The baud rate for the serial connection.

Template: kamstrup2mqtt/broker
Type: string
Default: tcp://localhost:1883
Description: MQTT broker URI:
 The URI of the MQTT broker (e.g., tcp://localhost:1883).

Template: kamstrup2mqtt/topic
Type: string
Default: serial/bridge
Description: MQTT topic:
 The topic where messages will be published.

Template: kamstrup2mqtt/client_id
Type: string
Default: kamstrup2mqtt-system
Description: MQTT client ID:
 The client ID to use for the MQTT connection.

Template: kamstrup2mqtt/qos
Type: select
Choices: 0, 1, 2
Default: 0
Description: MQTT QoS level:
 The Quality of Service level for MQTT messages.

Template: kamstrup2mqtt/mqtt_user
Type: string
Description: MQTT username (optional):
 Leave empty if no authentication is required.

Template: kamstrup2mqtt/mqtt_password
Type: password
Description: MQTT password (optional):
 Leave empty if no authentication is required.
